      "created_at": "2016-10-18T20:05:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm going with Fixed Point taking precedence. It's certainly in the spirit of things, and it just says \"all cards\" are indestructible, period.</p><p>(It occurred to me to wonder if an incapacitated hero could be destroyed by Cedisitic Dissonant. But alas, it's still a character card.)</p>",
