      "created_at": "2016-10-19T02:08:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can't see a card leaving the game yet remaining in play, so I would guess that in order to leave the game a card has to leave play. &nbsp;An indestructible card cannot leave play, so I can't see how it would be able to leave the game.</p>",
